<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-JAIC rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-JAIC rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Research Center Ltd has assigned Japan Asia Investment Co Ltd a &quot;1&quot; rating, Nikko brokers said on Friiday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;1&quot; ratingg to issues whose values it expects will outperform the key 225-share Nikkei average by more than 10 percentage pointts over the following six months.</p>
</text>
